{"unit_id":"OMSociety__dsh-ssh-tunnel#feature-1","repo":"OMSociety/dsh-ssh-tunnel","commit":"907eaf33ac15f0664028cc9db2d37e48242a81f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SSH Tunnel 的功能「远端命令」：通过 SSHManager 的 exec 动作在已授权主机运行命令，并返回标准输出、错误输出和退出状态；可指定远端工作目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1474-1503"]}
{"unit_id":"OMSociety__dsh-ssh-tunnel#feature-2","repo":"OMSociety/dsh-ssh-tunnel","commit":"907eaf33ac15f0664028cc9db2d37e48242a81f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SSH Tunnel 的功能「远端文件管理」：SSHManager 支持列举、查看、读写、创建目录、重命名和删除远端文件，并可在项目工作区与 SSH 主机之间上传或下载文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1533-1543","lib/index.js:1591-1619"]}
{"unit_id":"OMSociety__dsh-ssh-tunnel#feature-3","repo":"OMSociety/dsh-ssh-tunnel","commit":"907eaf33ac15f0664028cc9db2d37e48242a81f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SSH Tunnel 的功能「交互式终端」：用户可在中央面板打开远端 shell，读取输出、发送键盘输入并调整终端尺寸，也可从侧栏管理对应会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1506-1530","lib/client.js:1709-1736"]}
{"unit_id":"OMSociety__dsh-ssh-tunnel#feature-4","repo":"OMSociety/dsh-ssh-tunnel","commit":"907eaf33ac15f0664028cc9db2d37e48242a81f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SSH Tunnel 的功能「断线重连」：连接中断后会话会保留为断开状态，可重连或关闭；策略模块设置了最多三次自动重连及逐步延迟。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/session.js:259-270","lib/shared/session-policy.js:8-11"]}
